abstract: "Code, cached results and data behind every table and figure of 'Goodness-of-Fit Indices and Diagnostics for Topic Models' (Lewis and Grossetti): four simulation studies, the MD&A empirical application, and the September 2026 robustness arms. Methods are implemented in the R package OpTop."
